  "notes": "COMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n・{障害|しょうがい}を{排除|はいじょ}する - to remove obstacles\n・{不正|ふせい}を{排除|はいじょ}する - to eliminate misconduct\n・{危険|きけん}を{排除|はいじょ}する - to eliminate danger\n・{可能性|かのうせい}を{排除|はいじょ}する - to rule out a possibility\n\nUSAGE NOTES:\nPattern: Xを{排除|はいじょ}する (to exclude/remove X)\nCan refer to physical removal or abstract exclusion (of ideas, possibilities, etc.).\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n・{除外|じょがい} - exclusion (from a group/list)\n・{削除|さくじょ} - deletion (of data, text)\n・{除去|じょきょ} - removal (physical)",
